WEBVTT

00:00:04.330 --> 00:00:06.770
Lord Uro appeared suddenly at
Karasumori Academy.

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:13.170
He is not an Ayakashi,
but a unique living being,

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:16.940
a deity who presides
over nature.

00:00:19.110 --> 00:00:20.780
Every few decades,

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:26.650
Lord Uro appears before the Kekkaishi
to have them fix his bed.

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:33.490
Yoshimori and his grandfather Shigemori
went to the Colorless Marsh

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:37.230
to fulfill their duty as Kekkaishi.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:43.330
Yoshimori will
enter the bed of Lord Uro

00:00:43.670 --> 00:00:45.660
through the hole in the lake.

00:00:53.980 --> 00:00:56.140
However. What he entered was...

00:00:57.950 --> 00:00:59.890
the Divine Field.

00:01:10.530 --> 00:01:15.800
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:17.670
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:01:17.670 --> 00:01:22.880
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:01:22.880 --> 00:01:24.780
(Fighting late into the night)

00:01:25.280 --> 00:01:28.220
Drive away all hesitation

00:01:28.220 --> 00:01:32.620
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:01:32.790 --> 00:01:36.160
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:01:36.160 --> 00:01:39.490
I will protect you that's all
(that's all I want)

00:01:39.490 --> 00:01:45.160
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:01:47.470 --> 00:01:49.660
Sha la la la la...

00:01:51.010 --> 00:01:56.080
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:01:56.080 --> 00:01:58.050
(Secret romance)

00:01:58.050 --> 00:02:03.250
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:02:03.250 --> 00:02:05.010
(A strange distance)

00:02:05.490 --> 00:02:11.860
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:02:11.930 --> 00:02:12.930
Yeah

00:02:12.930 --> 00:02:16.400
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:20.000
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:25.340
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:02:40.390 --> 00:02:41.620
Hey kid!

00:02:53.070 --> 00:02:54.030
Oh right.

00:02:54.640 --> 00:02:56.760
I came here to
fix Lord Uro's bed.

00:02:57.310 --> 00:02:58.860
Hurry up, kid, come on!

00:03:04.550 --> 00:03:06.170
I still don't know what
to make of this.

00:03:06.980 --> 00:03:08.780
What are you doing Grandpa Shige?!

00:03:09.350 --> 00:03:12.550
You will be going to
the Divine Field.

00:03:12.850 --> 00:03:15.910
Divine? That thing?
What a cheap-looking deity.

00:03:16.390 --> 00:03:17.430
You fool!

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:18.760
If you lose even a little focus,

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:19.890
you will be swallowed!

00:03:19.890 --> 00:03:21.260
Swallowed?

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:24.230
This will act as a guide
to avoid that.

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:27.590
I'll write down what you need
to do on your left hand.

00:03:27.800 --> 00:03:30.000
I'm not a kindergartener.

00:03:30.070 --> 00:03:31.630
I won't forget something
so simple.

00:03:32.110 --> 00:03:33.800
You might.

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:36.580
Or rather, you'll become
utterly confused.

00:03:36.780 --> 00:03:38.710
I'm already confused.

00:03:38.850 --> 00:03:41.410
Don't make light of it.
It is a dangerous place.

00:03:41.720 --> 00:03:44.480
Many have failed to return
in the past.

00:03:45.390 --> 00:03:47.880
You're sending your cute grandson
to a place like that?

00:03:47.990 --> 00:03:49.820
What do you mean by "cute grandson"?

00:03:50.090 --> 00:03:51.520
The work itself is simple.

00:03:51.890 --> 00:03:55.660
You will fix a Magic Device
in his bed with Restoration Technique.

00:03:55.760 --> 00:03:56.560
Magic Device?

00:03:58.030 --> 00:04:00.470
Magic... Device.
This is how you spell it!

00:04:00.900 --> 00:04:02.600
What are you doing, Gramps?!

00:04:03.570 --> 00:04:05.730
So? What does this thing look like?

00:04:05.940 --> 00:04:07.240
You'll know when you get there.

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:10.080
Listen, you must finish
as quickly as possible.

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:11.810
Do not stay too long.

00:04:12.610 --> 00:04:14.170
The more guides you have,
the better.

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:16.940
Write down everything
you don't want to forget.

00:04:20.220 --> 00:04:21.780
The Divine Field huh?

00:04:28.760 --> 00:04:30.290
Hey kid! Hurry up!

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:31.990
R-Right away!

00:04:42.410 --> 00:04:44.170
A-A giant ball of Marimo algae?

00:04:44.710 --> 00:04:47.310
No must be the deity's bed.

00:04:48.620 --> 00:04:50.780
So this is where Lord Uro lives.

00:04:51.190 --> 00:04:53.680
I guess it does look like a place
where a deity might live.

00:04:57.960 --> 00:04:59.260
Hurry it up, kid!

00:05:00.060 --> 00:05:01.190
Oh shut up.

00:05:01.800 --> 00:05:04.490
The last one that came was
much more enthusiastic.

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:07.930
Enthusiastic? Just you watch.

00:05:08.270 --> 00:05:10.640
I'll fix it better than
Grandpa Shige!

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:11.770
Grandpa Shige?

00:05:12.810 --> 00:05:15.240
Oh. I guess he wasn't old
fifty years ago.

00:05:15.840 --> 00:05:18.330
Anyway, I won't lose to
a young Grandpa Shige!

00:05:18.710 --> 00:05:20.480
The last one who came was a woman.

00:05:20.520 --> 00:05:21.780
A woman-?

00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:26.010
Grandpa Shige isn't a woman.

00:05:26.350 --> 00:05:27.290
What are you talking about?

00:05:27.490 --> 00:05:28.850
It was certainly a young woman.

00:05:28.920 --> 00:05:30.320
Boing... Boing...

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:33.360
I guess they're talking
about Grandma Tokiko...

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:37.390
Grandpa Shige... made it
sound like he did it himself.

00:05:45.810 --> 00:05:47.670
Wait, Tokiko! I'll go!

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:51.050
No, Shigemori.
You're too inexperienced.

00:05:51.880 --> 00:05:53.350
We are going to the Divine Field.

00:05:53.610 --> 00:05:54.310
What?!

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:57.980
Don't underestimate me!
I am also the Legitimate Heir!

00:05:59.150 --> 00:06:01.360
And besides.
I can't let a woman go

00:06:01.360 --> 00:06:02.880
to such a dangerous place alone.

00:06:05.230 --> 00:06:08.460
You're only allowed to say something
like that if you have beaten me at least once.

00:06:11.900 --> 00:06:13.770
If big brother wasn't bedridden
with a fever.

00:06:13.770 --> 00:06:16.260
I would have sent you away!

00:06:20.640 --> 00:06:22.630
You have to listen to your elders.

00:06:24.050 --> 00:06:26.950
There must be one person to act
as the anchor on this side.

00:06:27.480 --> 00:06:28.810
You will stay here.

00:06:29.420 --> 00:06:30.540
B-But...

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:31.720
It's all right.

00:06:32.120 --> 00:06:34.990
I am completely ready for this.
I even wrote my own name.

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:38.420
Oh, it's fading already.

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:41.490
Give that to me!

00:06:42.300 --> 00:06:43.630
I'll rewrite it for you.

00:06:45.830 --> 00:06:48.860
You are Tokiko. Yukimura Tokiko.

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:54.510
I will be the anchor!

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:57.210
So that you can return safely.

00:06:58.750 --> 00:06:59.410
Okay!

00:07:09.760 --> 00:07:11.690
This thing... damn it...

00:07:31.950 --> 00:07:34.850
It's not wet. But it feels like water.

00:07:34.950 --> 00:07:36.350
Kid! Hurry up!

00:07:36.350 --> 00:07:39.290
Lord Uro has fallen asleep
because you're so slow!

00:07:39.690 --> 00:07:41.810
Shut up! People on the sidelines
should stay quiet!

00:07:44.490 --> 00:07:45.930
Go!

00:08:03.740 --> 00:08:05.470
Huh? I'm not in pain...

00:08:07.720 --> 00:08:10.010
I guess I don't need to hold my breath.

00:08:11.890 --> 00:08:13.350
Is this a kind of Kekkai?

00:08:13.990 --> 00:08:17.390
But it doesn't seem like
a deity's bed.

00:08:19.660 --> 00:08:21.060
So that's the Magic Device...

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:22.420
There we go.

00:08:22.830 --> 00:08:24.760
It's like there's no gravity.

00:08:31.410 --> 00:08:32.170
A box?

00:08:33.340 --> 00:08:36.900
It looks so old.
So I just need to restore this?

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:38.570
Or something inside?

00:08:39.510 --> 00:08:42.970
It's empty. So I have to restore
the box itself.

00:08:44.320 --> 00:08:45.810
This should be easy enough.

00:08:52.930 --> 00:08:53.760
Restore!

00:09:02.570 --> 00:09:05.410
Hey I thought I wasn't supposed to
use the Restoration Technique

00:09:05.410 --> 00:09:08.310
outside of Karasumori.

00:09:08.640 --> 00:09:10.770
Wait this isn't getting fixed at all!

00:09:11.850 --> 00:09:12.910
Come to think of it

00:09:12.910 --> 00:09:16.210
I always had a hard time
fixing broken stuff at home.

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:19.950
I'm putting so much power into it but

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:21.820
there's a long way to go
before it's restored.

00:09:23.760 --> 00:09:25.020
Fine, I'll use a Shikigami!

00:09:26.730 --> 00:09:29.030
No you fool!

00:09:29.360 --> 00:09:31.570
Besides you can only be
called a good Caster

00:09:31.570 --> 00:09:34.760
if you don't rely on your Shikigami!

00:09:35.070 --> 00:09:38.510
Fine! I'll do the Full Restoration
all on my own!

00:09:40.470 --> 00:09:42.170
Why, you!

00:09:49.380 --> 00:09:51.720
The kid seems to
be having trouble.

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:52.840
I wonder if he's all right?

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:54.310
Ouch!

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:42.070
I put all my strength into it!

00:10:42.440 --> 00:10:44.460
Looks like it's fixed. Perfect!

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:46.870
Wait, this place has gotten
a lot bigger.

00:10:47.210 --> 00:10:49.440
The bed has become much larger...

00:10:49.810 --> 00:10:51.470
Oh!

00:10:54.320 --> 00:10:55.940
What do you think about-?

00:11:00.520 --> 00:11:03.750
Well done. Kid.
Now that you're done, hurry home.

00:11:04.390 --> 00:11:07.020
A human's mental strength will
not last long here.

00:11:11.030 --> 00:11:11.900
I understand now.

00:11:12.300 --> 00:11:15.500
The Kekkai becomes complete
only when the deity enters.

00:11:16.170 --> 00:11:17.900
This is the Divine Field?!

00:11:20.640 --> 00:11:21.440
I'm going to be swallowed!

00:11:23.080 --> 00:11:25.140
Kid! Get a hold of yourself!

00:11:25.450 --> 00:11:27.680
Only think about returning
to the surface!

00:11:27.980 --> 00:11:30.350
Hurry up and go!
Once Lord Uro falls asleep,

00:11:30.350 --> 00:11:32.340
the hole you came through
will close.

00:11:32.490 --> 00:11:32.650
MY NAME IS YOSHIMORI
CASTLE OF SWEETS
SEALING KARASUMORI
TOKINE

00:11:32.650 --> 00:11:34.490
MY NAME IS YOSHIMORI
CASTLE OF SWEETS
SEALING KARASUMORI
TOKINE
Wait... not yet...

00:11:34.490 --> 00:11:34.750
MY NAME IS YOSHIMORI
CASTLE OF SWEETS
SEALING KARASUMORI
TOKINE

00:11:36.060 --> 00:11:38.490
I still have something
I want to ask him!

00:11:38.730 --> 00:11:40.160
Stop it kid!

00:11:42.360 --> 00:11:44.660
I know that I'm not
supposed to be here.

00:11:45.300 --> 00:11:50.640
This is the Divine Field. A place
so perfect that no one can infiltrate it.

00:11:51.610 --> 00:11:54.900
But there's something
I have to know!

00:11:56.640 --> 00:11:58.870
Lord Uro! Before you fall asleep,
please tell me!

00:11:59.010 --> 00:11:59.880
Kid!

00:12:00.110 --> 00:12:03.450
The forest you spoke of?
Is it Karasumori?

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:07.890
Wake up! Is Karasumori
the name of the land?

00:12:07.890 --> 00:12:09.650
Isn't it the name of the Lord?

00:12:09.860 --> 00:12:12.490
Was it Tokimori that asked
you to give the land?

00:12:12.490 --> 00:12:15.690
Who was it?
What did he do to you?!

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:17.290
Stop it right there, kid!

00:12:17.870 --> 00:12:18.730
Answer me!

00:12:21.570 --> 00:12:26.130
Hurry up and go, kid!
A human cannot last long here!

00:12:26.310 --> 00:12:28.610
The hole to the surface
will close soon!

00:12:29.940 --> 00:12:31.780
Shut up. I know that.

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:36.480
I know. I can sense it with my whole body.
I'm a Kekkaishi. After all.

00:12:37.450 --> 00:12:39.180
I'm a foreign presence here.

00:12:39.590 --> 00:12:41.950
This whole world is trying to reject me.

00:12:42.590 --> 00:12:43.560
If you know,

00:12:43.560 --> 00:12:45.020
that is all the more reason
for you to hurry.

00:12:45.130 --> 00:12:45.960
But!

00:12:46.760 --> 00:12:49.490
As long as I'm here,
this place can't be complete.

00:12:49.700 --> 00:12:50.490
Isn't that right?

00:12:51.900 --> 00:12:55.130
That's why you won't be able
to fully fall asleep. Am I right?

00:12:56.440 --> 00:12:59.960
Now answer me!
How do I seal Karasumori?!

00:13:00.440 --> 00:13:01.410
How... do I...

00:13:03.840 --> 00:13:07.540
Don't be unreasonable.
You must hurry or else...

00:13:08.350 --> 00:13:09.410
You'll be erased.

00:13:12.520 --> 00:13:15.680
I'm sorry, Lord Uro... but I...

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:19.790
There's someone I want to protect...

00:13:21.030 --> 00:13:24.760
I want to know... please... tell me...

00:13:26.400 --> 00:13:32.470
The human...
When he asked me for the forest...

00:13:32.470 --> 00:13:34.340
Was crying...

00:13:36.540 --> 00:13:39.170
How sad...

00:13:44.250 --> 00:13:45.410
He's at his limit.

00:13:52.030 --> 00:13:53.050
Kid!

00:13:53.630 --> 00:13:55.960
It's now up to you whether
you can go back or not.

00:13:55.960 --> 00:13:58.690
Think only about the surface!

00:14:05.440 --> 00:14:07.430
Was it always this dark here?

00:14:24.730 --> 00:14:26.720
What? I...

00:14:28.400 --> 00:14:29.690
Oh, right. I have to go.

00:14:29.930 --> 00:14:30.690
To where?

00:14:31.970 --> 00:14:32.930
To... where?

00:14:33.670 --> 00:14:35.190
Wait. Where am I?

00:14:35.700 --> 00:14:37.170
Where is this place?

00:14:37.500 --> 00:14:39.200
This place? Where am I?

00:14:40.640 --> 00:14:42.370
That's right. The guides...

00:14:46.350 --> 00:14:48.680
There's something... important...

00:14:50.820 --> 00:14:52.340
Who's Yoshimori?

00:14:53.520 --> 00:14:54.420
I don't know.

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:55.810
Who are you?

00:14:57.990 --> 00:15:01.160
I don't know... I just don't know...

00:15:01.260 --> 00:15:03.590
You don't know yourself.

00:15:04.130 --> 00:15:05.600
You don't remember anything.

00:15:06.030 --> 00:15:07.400
I don't remember anything...

00:15:08.540 --> 00:15:10.500
But you know...

00:15:13.610 --> 00:15:17.980
You don't know who you are...
but you know.

00:15:19.010 --> 00:15:21.410
Don't lie about it.
You know.

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:24.710
There is nothing here.

00:15:26.750 --> 00:15:30.380
There is nothing here.
You are not here.

00:15:31.060 --> 00:15:34.260
You were never here
from the beginning.

00:15:38.700 --> 00:15:40.530
I'm scared... I'm scared...

00:15:41.700 --> 00:15:44.260
Somebody help...

00:15:50.510 --> 00:15:52.780
This is bad.
It's just like that time.

00:15:56.780 --> 00:15:59.010
Tokiko! Hurry up
and come back!

00:16:13.570 --> 00:16:14.470
I'm scared.

00:16:17.540 --> 00:16:18.600
Somebody...

00:16:21.880 --> 00:16:23.100
Help me...

00:16:26.680 --> 00:16:29.510
It's stuck.
My leg is stuck!

00:16:31.150 --> 00:16:32.280
Stop crying.

00:16:34.690 --> 00:16:37.660
It's all right
I'll help you.

00:16:37.960 --> 00:16:39.550
Here...
Reach out your hand...

00:16:44.700 --> 00:16:45.560
Yoshimori...

00:16:49.040 --> 00:16:50.060
Yoshimori...

00:16:53.810 --> 00:16:54.640
Yoshimori...

00:16:58.910 --> 00:16:59.710
Yoshimori...

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:01.950
That's right.

00:17:02.820 --> 00:17:03.650
Tokine...

00:17:22.700 --> 00:17:24.330
I'm glad you made it back.

00:17:32.780 --> 00:17:33.750
It can't be...

00:17:36.680 --> 00:17:38.880
It's all right.
You're safe now. Yoshimori.

00:17:45.560 --> 00:17:49.720
I hugged Grandpa Shige with
all my might. While crying too.

00:17:49.860 --> 00:17:50.990
You want some tea?

00:17:51.530 --> 00:17:52.970
I really want to cry...

00:17:53.170 --> 00:17:54.640
You returned to your senses quickly.

00:17:54.640 --> 00:17:55.530
You'll be fine.

00:17:55.970 --> 00:17:58.270
But this job may have been
too much for you.

00:17:58.270 --> 00:17:59.900
I should have gone myself.

00:18:00.270 --> 00:18:02.610
But I had my own reasons.

00:18:03.540 --> 00:18:08.380
Unlike me, you can still grow.
No. You must grow.

00:18:09.020 --> 00:18:10.480
I have a bad feeling about things.

00:18:10.880 --> 00:18:12.320
The repairs on Lord Uro's bed,

00:18:12.320 --> 00:18:13.750
should last for 100 years

00:18:13.750 --> 00:18:15.310
every time it's restored.

00:18:16.220 --> 00:18:18.920
Tokiko should have
restored it completely.

00:18:19.830 --> 00:18:22.230
But. This is the first time
another restoration

00:18:22.230 --> 00:18:25.030
was needed after only fifty years.

00:18:25.400 --> 00:18:26.800
I don't get it.

00:18:26.970 --> 00:18:29.630
Even fifty years ago,
you weren't the one who restored it.

00:18:30.140 --> 00:18:32.000
Anyway, what's with that Kekkai?

00:18:32.310 --> 00:18:34.370
Are castles made of sweets
that important?

00:18:34.980 --> 00:18:37.380
I think you're still not right
in the head.

00:18:37.640 --> 00:18:39.010
You need some rest.

00:18:39.080 --> 00:18:41.710
What's going on?
My head is spinning!

00:18:41.980 --> 00:18:46.110
Something big is happening
to Karasumori.

00:18:46.290 --> 00:18:48.810
We Kekkaishi, must be prepared.

00:18:49.520 --> 00:18:52.360
The Legitimate Heir, you must...

00:18:52.460 --> 00:18:55.660
Calm down. Calm down.
What's one plus one?

00:18:57.260 --> 00:18:59.560
Should I take your place
at work tonight?

00:18:59.970 --> 00:19:01.590
Shut up! I'm fine!

00:19:02.540 --> 00:19:05.800
If he took any longer,
he would have been swallowed up.

00:19:06.470 --> 00:19:09.070
Like grandfather, like grandson.

00:19:09.340 --> 00:19:12.240
The Sumimuras always worry me.

00:19:17.020 --> 00:19:19.450
Just what is Karasumori?

00:19:20.020 --> 00:19:23.890
Lord Uro was there.
But he gave it to Tokimori.

00:19:24.360 --> 00:19:25.020
I don't understand.

00:19:25.360 --> 00:19:26.160
Yoshimori.

00:19:26.490 --> 00:19:29.090
Was Lord Uro's bed fixed?

00:19:29.530 --> 00:19:30.050
Yeah.

00:19:30.430 --> 00:19:33.490
Grandma won't really explain it to me.

00:19:33.600 --> 00:19:34.930
But what was the bed like?

00:19:35.370 --> 00:19:38.070
It's not something I can explain.

00:19:38.410 --> 00:19:39.100
Come on.

00:19:39.610 --> 00:19:41.010
It wasn't anything great.

00:19:41.840 --> 00:19:43.570
In short. It looked like
Marimo algae.

00:19:43.810 --> 00:19:44.540
Marimo algae?!

00:19:45.110 --> 00:19:47.600
I did a lot of thinking
while I was there.

00:19:47.980 --> 00:19:51.110
Anyways, why won't you look at me?

00:19:52.250 --> 00:19:56.880
I get the feeling that
Tokine saved me again.

00:19:57.820 --> 00:19:58.690
Yoshimori...

00:20:01.160 --> 00:20:03.490
Yoshimori! Wait. Yoshimori!

00:20:03.560 --> 00:20:05.120
What were you thinking about?

00:20:05.470 --> 00:20:07.760
Shut up! Stop calling my name so much!

00:20:07.900 --> 00:20:09.330
Why, Yoshimori?

00:20:09.370 --> 00:20:11.170
I don't know why, but stop it!

00:20:11.270 --> 00:20:14.010
Yoshimori! Yoshimori! Yoshimori!

00:20:14.010 --> 00:20:15.300
- Shut up!
- Yoshimori!

00:20:18.910 --> 00:20:20.850
The weather is nice again today.

00:20:20.850 --> 00:20:22.410
One two. One two.

00:20:29.320 --> 00:20:30.760
What was that for?!

00:20:30.820 --> 00:20:33.660
I was thinking of bringing back
a little moisture

00:20:33.660 --> 00:20:35.720
to that withered face of yours.

00:20:35.930 --> 00:20:38.060
Why, you!

00:20:38.600 --> 00:20:40.230
Lord Uro's bed broke

00:20:40.230 --> 00:20:42.960
because your restoration
was incomplete!

00:20:43.940 --> 00:20:46.740
Oh? I restored it completely back then!

00:20:46.770 --> 00:20:48.910
If I hadn't pulled you out,
you would have been swallowed.

00:20:48.910 --> 00:20:50.000
I'm sure of it!

00:20:50.740 --> 00:20:52.850
No. Even without your help,

00:20:52.850 --> 00:20:55.180
I would have been able to return.

00:20:56.550 --> 00:20:58.070
You ungrateful witch!
I'll punish you!

00:20:58.320 --> 00:21:00.220
Yoshimori, please do something!

00:21:00.490 --> 00:21:02.720
Just leave them alone.

00:21:02.860 --> 00:21:04.790
It's not that. You have to come.

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:06.550
We have trouble in the kitchen.

00:21:08.300 --> 00:21:09.830
After Lord Uro left,

00:21:09.830 --> 00:21:12.530
I tried to clean the moss
that was growing all over,

00:21:12.570 --> 00:21:13.290
but this time...

00:21:14.370 --> 00:21:15.560
A tree grew!

00:21:18.440 --> 00:21:20.630
This was where he sat.

00:21:21.380 --> 00:21:25.110
What should I do?
It's bearing something.

00:21:28.050 --> 00:21:29.070
Donuts?!

00:21:31.420 --> 00:21:32.210
What is this?

00:21:32.650 --> 00:21:35.020
Gross. Is this for real?!

00:21:38.960 --> 00:21:42.290
I should have made my rounds
yesterday to clean up.

00:21:43.500 --> 00:21:44.400
Morning...

00:21:44.500 --> 00:21:46.900
S-Sumimura-kun!
What is that thing?

00:21:47.500 --> 00:21:49.970
It's all right. Should be harmless.

00:21:50.370 --> 00:21:53.640
Is it the green curse,
or is it the moss demon?

00:21:53.870 --> 00:21:55.540
What's a moss demon?

00:21:56.310 --> 00:21:58.010
I wonder if it's all right
at Tokine's side.

00:22:02.580 --> 00:22:04.280
What's with this chicken?!

00:22:04.280 --> 00:22:06.180
Somebody do something!

00:22:10.460 --> 00:22:12.690
Wow! It's a bed of grass!

00:22:14.090 --> 00:22:15.560
It's so comfortable!

00:22:17.100 --> 00:22:19.930
I guess I'll clean it up after
a quick nap.

00:22:33.910 --> 00:22:36.750
There's a giant strawberry
on Mr. Kurosu's desk!

00:22:48.700 --> 00:22:52.390
I will take the road
I believe in anywhere

00:22:53.030 --> 00:22:56.800
Wanting to protect what's
in front of my eyes

00:22:57.500 --> 00:23:01.100
The world I have yet
to know is endless

00:23:01.910 --> 00:23:05.540
I know it will make
my heart dance

00:23:07.350 --> 00:23:18.020
I feel like I could fly
For the one I love

00:23:18.060 --> 00:23:26.760
Even if I search the whole world
No one could replace you

00:23:27.470 --> 00:23:31.600
Not everyone has a tomorrow

00:23:31.640 --> 00:23:40.210
Don't cry

00:23:40.250 --> 00:23:48.950
Even if I search the whole world
No one could replace you

00:23:49.620 --> 00:23:53.790
We weren't born
to hurt each other

00:23:53.830 --> 00:24:02.200
Don't cry
